        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your royal treasury is empty. Your kingdom? A sad pile of dirt. But you have one thing going for you: a shiny gold nugget and an irresistible urge to click it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Clicker Kingdom, a cozy medieval idle clicker wrapped in gorgeous pixel art where your clicking obsession finally pays off.</p>[h3]TAP YOUR WAY TO GLORY[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click fills your coffers with precious gold. It's simple. It's satisfying. It's oddly therapeutic. Start with nothing but your finger and a dream of endless wealth.</p>[h3]BUILD YOUR MEDIEVAL EMPIRE[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned gold on 20 buildings across 8 medieval guilds — Mining, Farming, Smithy, Cooking, Quackery, Engineering, Alchemy, and Magic. Each one generates passive income while you sleep, eat, or pretend to work. Watch your realm transform from a muddy village into a glittering empire.</p>[h3]HIRE AN ARMY OF MINIONS[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why click alone when you can hire peasants to do the dirty work? Recruit workers, upgrade their skills across 315 upgrades, and turn your kingdom into a gold-generating machine. They don't even ask for vacation days.</p>[h3]ASCEND TO GREATNESS[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reached the ceiling? Smash through it. The Ascension system lets you reset your progress for permanent upgrades across 24 different paths. Each rebirth makes you stronger, richer, and closer to medieval world domination.</p>[h3]RULE ALONGSIDE YOUR TWITCH CHAT[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming? Let your viewers join the kingdom. Connect your Twitch channel and every chatter who types <strong>#kingdom</strong> spawns as a peasant in your realm. Turn your stream into a living, growing medieval village.</p>[h3]FEATURES:[/h3]<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy idle clicker gameplay with satisfying progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art medieval aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 buildings across 8 unique guilds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >315 upgrades to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with 24 ascension paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 achievements to chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle income while you're away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Twitch chat integration for streamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 20 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud saves across devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions or long binges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have five minutes or five hours, Clicker Kingdom rewards every tap, every upgrade, and every moment of gold-hoarding glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom awaits. Time to click.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your royal treasury is empty. Your kingdom? A sad pile of dirt. But you have one thing going for you: a shiny gold nugget and an irresistible urge to click it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Clicker Kingdom, a cozy medieval idle clicker wrapped in gorgeous pixel art where your clicking obsession finally pays off.</p>[h3]TAP YOUR WAY TO GLORY[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click fills your coffers with precious gold. It's simple. It's satisfying. It's oddly therapeutic. Start with nothing but your finger and a dream of endless wealth.</p>[h3]BUILD YOUR MEDIEVAL EMPIRE[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned gold on 20 buildings across 8 medieval guilds — Mining, Farming, Smithy, Cooking, Quackery, Engineering, Alchemy, and Magic. Each one generates passive income while you sleep, eat, or pretend to work. Watch your realm transform from a muddy village into a glittering empire.</p>[h3]HIRE AN ARMY OF MINIONS[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why click alone when you can hire peasants to do the dirty work? Recruit workers, upgrade their skills across 315 upgrades, and turn your kingdom into a gold-generating machine. They don't even ask for vacation days.</p>[h3]ASCEND TO GREATNESS[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reached the ceiling? Smash through it. The Ascension system lets you reset your progress for permanent upgrades across 24 different paths. Each rebirth makes you stronger, richer, and closer to medieval world domination.</p>[h3]RULE ALONGSIDE YOUR TWITCH CHAT[/h3]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming? Let your viewers join the kingdom. Connect your Twitch channel and every chatter who types <strong>#kingdom</strong> spawns as a peasant in your realm. Turn your stream into a living, growing medieval village.</p>[h3]FEATURES:[/h3]<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy idle clicker gameplay with satisfying progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art medieval aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 buildings across 8 unique guilds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >315 upgrades to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with 24 ascension paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 achievements to chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle income while you're away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Twitch chat integration for streamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 20 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud saves across devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions or long binges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have five minutes or five hours, Clicker Kingdom rewards every tap, every upgrade, and every moment of gold-hoarding glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom awaits. Time to click.</p>",
        "short_description": "Click gold. Build a kingdom. Become disgustingly rich. A cozy medieval idle clicker across 8 guilds, 20 buildings, and 315 upgrades. Ascend. Prestige. Repeat. Even your Twitch chat can join the realm. 50 achievements await, Your Majesty.",
